OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry with sunny
OL,7,Fspells on Monday. Showers and possibly
OL,8,Fthunderstorms developing from Tuesday,
OL,9,Fsome locally heavy. Feeling warmer,
OL,10,Fespecially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
